# Paths chezmoi must NOT write on this machine.

# ── GTK is owned by KDE, do not manage it ────────────────────────────────────
# kde-gtk-config's kded module (gtkconfig.so) regenerates these from the live
# Plasma colour scheme on EVERY scheme change — verified: gtk-4.0/gtk.css,
# gtk-4.0/colors.css, gtk-3.0/colors.css and .gtkrc-2.0 were all rewritten
# within milliseconds of each other at login. A chezmoi-managed copy would be
# silently clobbered and would look like a theming bug.
# `gtk-theme-name=Breeze` is CORRECT on Plasma: Breeze is the widget style and
# KDE recolours it. Do not "fix" it.
#
# NB: this rule has now flipped twice, so the reasoning is worth recording.
# It was briefly INVERTED while this repo targeted niri + Noctalia: with no
# kded there is nothing regenerating GTK config, so leaving it unmanaged left
# GTK apps on default Adwaita forever — the same symptom as clobbering, from
# the opposite cause. Returning to Plasma returns the original rule. The test
# is simply "does something else already own these files?" — under Plasma it
# does, under a bare compositor it does not.
.config/gtk-3.0
.config/gtk-4.0
.gtkrc-2.0
.gtkrc-2.0.mine

# ── Runtime / machine-local state, never source-controlled ───────────────────
.config/chezmoi
.local/state

# ── Secrets: generated per machine by scripts/secrets-setup.sh, never stored ──
.ssh
.config/gh
.npmrc
.nuget
.docker/config.json

# ── Desktop machine only ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NB: .chezmoiignore is processed as a TEMPLATE whether or not it ends in
# .tmpl, so this needs no rename. The patterns are TARGET paths (.config/...),
# never source names (private_dot_config/...).
#
# NB: the condition is `ne .profile "desktop"`, not `eq ... "laptop"`. If the
# profile key is ever something unexpected, the safe answer is "do not write
# gaming and video-editing config into that machine's home directory", and only
# the `ne` form gives that. The `eq` form would write them on every machine
# that is not literally named laptop.
{{- if ne .profile "desktop" }}
.config/MangoHud
.config/gamemode.ini
.local/bin/resolve
.local/share/applications/com.blackmagicdesign.resolve.desktop
{{- end }}
